    <innerclass refid="class_loader_overlay" prot="public">LoaderOverlay</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Full-screen spinner overlay shown during connection / loading operations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Covers the entire parent component. Text reads: &quot;⠋ [message] (5/194)&quot;. Frame advancement is driven exclusively by a 10 Hz juce::Timer when the overlay is visible.</para>
<para><ref refid="classFont" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">Font</ref> and colours match <ref refid="class_message_overlay" kindref="compound">MessageOverlay</ref> (overlayFamily / overlaySize / overlayColour).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>All methods MESSAGE THREAD. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="class_message_overlay" kindref="compound">MessageOverlay</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
